Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Feature Extraction", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"99a47698-7941-4ce9-bcad-611ae77f813d"],

Cell["\<\
Behind the scenes, most machine learning algorithms work on vectors of real \
numbers. So you need to create a mapping from and to the data space that you \
are starting with. This is done by a \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]feature extractor\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] (or an \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]encoder\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]):\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7f3ccf73-dbef-4919-bef4-0e5677cc74ce"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

